<BaseLayout title="Misc Odds & Ends" description="Small parts and tips for LS Genesis Coupe swaps that don't fit anywhere else, like the LOJ Gen III/IV oil pressure sender adapter and fitting 15-inch drag pack wheels.">
  <h1>Misc Odds &amp; Ends</h1>
  <p>Small parts and tips that don't need a guide of their own.</p>
  <nav class="toc">
    <a href="#oil-pressure-adapter">Oil pressure sender adapter</a>
